WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:00,940
you can't do this

2
00:00:00,940 --> 00:00:01,940
let me stay

3
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,380
I can help you with your work and keep the water out of your way.

4
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:05,540
Help you pick fruits

5
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:08,000
Just the little work you did

6
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:09,520
I can do it easily

7
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:11,400
But the rations you need to eat every day

8
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:13,200
It's enough food for one person out of ten

9
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:16,260
This deal is not a good deal. Maybe it comes occasionally.

10
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:19,140
It's impossible for me to support you for a long time

11
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:21,580
Then can I still come in the future?

12
00:00:22,550 --> 00:00:23,750
As long as it's a fair deal

13
00:00:23,990 --> 00:00:26,980
Of course you are welcome at any time, I am a person

14
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:28,100
It's actually not that narrow-minded

15
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:29,940
It was you who crossed the river first and demolished the wall.

16
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:32,980
I don’t believe that the collected seeds have been planted.

17
00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:34,380
You can be at peace with each other

18
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:39,960
This is not the way to go

19
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:41,820
The collection range is so large

20
00:00:42,220 --> 00:00:43,820
There's just not enough food to fill your stomach

21
00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:46,140
I propose to separate a pair of two

22
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:47,940
Look further afield

23
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:50,330
Isn’t Brother Lin the most sober after all?

24
00:00:50,770 --> 00:00:51,970
Follow Chen Yao to the second pair

25
00:00:52,490 --> 00:00:53,410
Take the long way

26
00:00:53,410 --> 00:00:57,370
Do more practical things and save your mouth.

27
00:00:57,370 --> 00:00:59,010
You go with him every day

28
00:00:59,010 --> 00:01:00,250
No need to stay in the camp and stand there

29
00:01:00,570 --> 00:01:03,890
Okay, Sister Weiwei, I’ll go too

30
00:01:04,130 --> 00:01:06,170
There must be a personal leader in Yuanlinzi

31
00:01:06,570 --> 00:01:09,050
If you can't find anything to eat, you'll have to share it first.

32
00:01:09,330 --> 00:01:15,320
I've explored the area three miles to the north. How much can I get if I pay more than ten bucks? I won't vote for it. Zhao Ya

33
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:18,240
Your collection efficiency is too slow starting today

34
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:19,880
You are in a group with Shen Xiaotang and Zhou Ting

35
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:21,840
Go dig on the slope to the east

36
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:23,400
Don't come back if you don't dig enough.
